<title>USA: Montana Power 333 MW unit seen up late Fri.</title>
<headline>Montana Power 333 MW unit seen up late Fri.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montana Power Co said Friday a 330 megawatt (MW) unit 2 at the Colstrip coal-fired power plant should be back on line by late this evening.</p>
<p>The unit, located 110 miles northeast of Billings, Mont., was taken off-line earlier this week for unplanned maintenance, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761</p>
